Subject: Re: [distance-sampling] Model Definition Properties for Mongolian Wild Camel Study
Message-ID: <moKyj2a97Lk.mbYe-RJ8BQAJ@distance-sampling.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <moKyj2a97Lk._jXvh7EdBQAJ@distance-sampling.groups.google.com>
